script = ExtResource("1")
name = "family_blood_a3"
description = "The Blood family built on purpose at the act III boss: expected_a3's level, armor and shrine, a Rare Lance (brutal, swift) with the family's runes (leech_rune, fury_rune), and 10 perks leaning on the family (3+ pieces awake): vampirism, vitality, bloodrage, devotion, frenzy, precision, strength, executioner, war_banner. Compared with the other family builds and expected_a3 (pillar 3: builds, not piles; pillar 4: comparable families)."
